Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 15:21:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ggml-cuda: add RDNA3.5 fast prefill path

Applies the issue 21284-style private Strix tuning: RDNA3.5 MMQ x limit, fast math in selected prefill kernels, quantize rounding intrinsic, and concat address hoisting. Records correctness and benchmark results in the Strix Halo notes.

Assisted-by: OpenCode
