+- Full-risk source delta over final source:
+  - `mmq.cuh`: RDNA3.5 `mmq_x_max=48` instead of `64`.
+  - `gated_delta_net.cu`: GDN-only `__expf` for `GGML_USE_HIP && RDNA3_5`.
